WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Setup, data, modules, cases, agent flow and approval.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:23.000
python demo.py: sample data and decisions, about half a second.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:39.000
No install: add a user, start the service. First answer in 2.3 s.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Nine CSV files and one invoice text. In stok.csv, quantities, safety stock and costs cannot be negative.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:10.000
ingest: validate, load, snapshot. kalite: quality check and rejected rows.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:22.000
calistir: six modules and one summary, all as JSON.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Status by coverage days, plus ABC class. Sample data.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Seven kinds of order versus goods-receipt mismatch. All seven planted cases were found in sample data.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Eight-week forecast, 80% interval. Sample average error 8.07%, simple baseline 11.16%.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Score from delivery, rejects and price deviation. Sample: T-01 A, T-03 D.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Order, delivery note, invoice: four kinds of mismatch. No OCR.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:26.000
OEE, downtime Pareto, root-cause suggestion. A suggestion, not proof.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:37.000
Turkish summary. Template by default; a language model is optional.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:49.000
Each finding becomes a case with an owner, a status and a target date.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Acceptance needs a reason. Every change is in the audit trail. 'Who' is a label.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:13.000
The planner splits the task. The analyst calls tools. The checker verifies in code.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Real model run: first attempt rejected, second accepted.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:39.000
Each trace shows its source. Real model: 38 runs recorded.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Approval is given on a summary. If it does not match, the tool does not run.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Contract-compliant data first, then ingest, quality check and calistir.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:19.000
No language model by default, no SAP or OCR link, not tested on company data.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:33.000
Known limits: a leak and a scale error can pass. Fix the data first.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:42.000
Source code is not in this release. Numbers and limits are on the evidence page.
